---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy | Edubuzz"
  description="How Edubuzz uses cookies and similar technologies, including cookies set by analytics providers."
  canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href}
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This Cookie Policy explains how Edubuzz ("we", "us", "our") uses cookies and similar technologies on edubuzz.co.za. It should be read together with our <a href="/privacy" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">What are cookies?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They help the site remember your actions and preferences and allow us to understand how the site is used.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Types of cookies we use</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — required for core functionality such as sign-in sessions and security (CSRF protection). The site cannot work correctly without these.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — help us understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. These may be set by Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Edubuzz does not currently display advertising and does not use advertising cookies. If advertising is introduced in the future, this policy will be updated before any advertising cookies are set.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Managing cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Most web browsers let you control cookies through their settings. You can block or delete cookies at any time, but please note that some parts of the site may not function properly if you do.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For any questions about our use of cookies, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
